<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHAMPTON WIN DIVISION THREE PLAY-OFF FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHAMPTON WIN DIVISION THREE PLAY-OFF FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northampton beat Swansea  1-0 (halftime 0-0) to win the English division three play-off final on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: John Frain 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 46,800</p>
<p>Northampton play in division two next season.</p>
</text>
